          "type": "singleCorrect",
          "level": 2,
          "question": {
            "text": "If x satisfies $|3 x-2|+|3 x-4|+|3 x-6| \\geq 12$, then",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "57T02",
              "text": "$0 \\leq \\mathrm{x} \\geq \\frac{8}{3}$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "T5SXv",
              "text": "$x \\geq \\frac{8}{3}$ or $\\frac{-4}{3}$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "Q4H9R",
              "text": "$x \\leq 0$ or $x \\geq \\frac{8}{3}$",
              "isCorrect": true,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "ROUu9",
              "text": "$x \\geq 2$ only",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "Dividing $\\mathrm{R}$ at $\\frac{2}{3}, \\frac{4}{3}$ and $2,$ analyse 4 cases. When $\\mathrm{x} \\leq \\frac{2}{3},$ the inequality becomes $2-3 x+4-3 x+6-3 x \\geq 12$\r\n\r\nimplying $-9 x \\geq 0 \\Rightarrow x \\leq 0$\r\n\r\nwhen $\\mathrm{x} \\geq 2$ the ineqality becomes $3 x-2+3 x-4+3 x-6 \\geq 12$\r\n\r\nImplying $9 \\mathrm{x} \\geq 24 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{x} \\geq 8 / 3$\r\n\r\nThe inequality in invalid in the other two sections.\r\n\r\n$\\therefore$ either $x \\leq 0$ or $x \\geq 8 / 3$",
            "image": null
          },
