              "text": "$(-\\infty,-4) \\cup(4, \\infty)$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "PkaJb",
              "text": "$(-\\infty,-3) \\cup(4, \\infty)$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "egi38",
              "text": "$(-\\infty,-3) \\cup(3, \\infty)$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "Given, $\\frac{3-|x|}{4-|x|} \\geq 0$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow 3-|x| \\leq 0$ and $4-|x|<0$\r\n\r\nor $3-|x| \\geq 0$ and $4-|x|<0$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow|x| \\geq 3$ and $|x|>4$\r\n\r\nor $|x| \\leq 3$ and $|x|<4$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow|x|>4$ or $|x| \\leq 3$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow x \\in(-\\infty,-4) \\cup[-3,3] \\cup(4, \\infty)$",
            "image": null
          },
