            {
              "id": "uFXtD",
              "text": "16",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "$x y-12 x-12 y=0 \\Rightarrow(x-12)(y-12)=144$\r\nNow 144 can be factorised into two factors $x$ and $y$ where $x \\leq y$ and the factors are (1,144),(2,72),(3,48),(4,36),(6,24),(8,18)\r\n(9,16),(12,12)\r\nThus there are eight solutions.",
